{
  "dataset": "Symptom timing (症狀時間) controlled vocabulary",
  "policy": [
    "Values for a symptom card's clinical_attributes.timing — WHEN a symptom appears or worsens. Timing is diagnostic in TCM (午後潮熱 vs 晨起頭重) so it is a closed set.",
    "This is the CARD axis: which timings are worth asking about for this symptom. The patient's actual answer on a given visit is a case observation, not a card value.",
    "IDs are ASCII (D10)."
  ],
  "created": "2026-08-06",
  "applies_to": "sym.* records via clinical_attributes.timing",
  "records": [
